        "Content": "<ul><li>OUTBUILDINGS & FEATURES</li><li></li><li>Historic stone outbuildings with slate roofs.</li><li>Walled garden to the south-west of the house.</li><li>Courtyard accessed by wrought iron gates.</li><li>Stone and brick outbuilding dated 1883.</li><li>Ashlar gate piers with carved caps and sweeping boundary walls.</li><li>Bellcote, date plaques, external stairs, and timber/metal doors with Gothic and Classical detailing.</li><li></li><li></li><li>SERVICES</li><li></li><li>Water from private bore well, electricity, broadband, oil fired central heating and drainage by septic tank. </li><li></li><li></li><li>OUTSIDE</li><li></li><li>Private gardens, lawned areas, walled in garden/orchard and stone built outbuildings which are suitable for conversation in to self contained accommodation (subject to planning permission).</li><li></li><li></li><li>BER</li><li></li><li>BER Exempt</li><li></li><li></li><li>FEATURES</li><li></li><li>All magnificent period features have been retained.</ul>"
